[b]Permissions:[/b] the mod is under the [url=https://github.com/PaulRouss3l/slay_the_sector/blob/main/LICENSE]MIT license[/url]: use, change, fork or redistribute it freely, as long as the copyright notice and the license text stay with it.

[spoiler=AI use disclaimer]
Some or all assets and code in this mod were created using AI tools:
[list]
[li][b]Code:[/b] Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), through Claude Code. It wrote most of the Java code, the build and test tooling configuration, and the design and API documentation.[/li]
[li][b]Code review:[/b] Claude was also used to review each milestone for bugs before release. No line of code reaches a release without a human review.[/li]
[li][b]Art:[/b] the banner at the top of this post was made with Z-Image Turbo (Alibaba's Tongyi Lab), an open image model run locally in ComfyUI, starting from vanilla Starsector portraits; its three captains are a nod to Slay the Spire's Ironclad, Silent and Defect. Nothing in the mod itself uses AI art: map and node icons are vanilla Starsector sprites.[/li]
[/list]
How it was made: I designed the mod (the Run, the beacon types, the rules and the balance) and directed every change. Each milestone was then played and tested in game by me, against a checklist, before it was merged. The full source and the design notes are public on GitHub.
[/spoiler]
